      en: ["Founded in 1965 as a uniquely protected coastal forest park.", "The size of the entire protected area slightly exceeds 600 hectares.", "Created specifically to preserve the historically significant Caspian box tree.", "The dense tree line ends almost directly at the sandy shores of the Caspian Sea.", "Geographically belongs to the rainy and forest-rich Mazandaran province.", "Consists of a tourist recreation zone and a strict nature reserve zone.", "Provides an important natural habitat for mammals such as the golden jackal and red fox."],
